* 11-mosfet-power-subckt.lib - generic power NMOS subcircuit with body diode
* SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
* Written for the Omnia P0.3 spike. Generic parameters, no vendor data.
.SUBCKT NMOS_POWER D G S PARAMS: RG=2.5 RDS=20m
RG G G1 {RG}
M1 D1 G1 S S MPOW L=1u W=1u
RD D D1 {RDS}
DBODY S D DBODY
.MODEL MPOW NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=2.8 KP=25 LAMBDA=0.01 CGSO=1.2n CGDO=0.3n)
.MODEL DBODY D (IS=2.5p RS=8m N=1.05 TT=60n CJO=900p M=0.45 BV=60)
.ENDS NMOS_POWER
